{"id":"sh/gbedwfmx","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 1","position":{"left":110.4,"top":46.08,"width":1046.4,"height":52.8},"text":"みちびきを使う理由と検証","style":{"fontSize":34.67,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/rm5czq50","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 2","position":{"left":112.32,"top":102.72,"width":1017.6,"height":32.64},"text":"テーマ2：位置精度の改善を、実際の捜索のしやすさにつなげる","style":{"fontSize":14.67,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#666666","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/6lwvql4v","kind":"shape","name":"Shape 3","position":{"left":72,"top":139.2,"width":161.28,"height":32.64},"style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#0557FF","lineColor":"#0557FF","lineWidth":1.33},
{"id":"sh/t8ne10n6","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 4","position":{"left":77.76,"top":144.96,"width":149.76,"height":19.2},"text":"THEME 2","style":{"fontSize":12.67,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#FFFFFF","bold":true,"alignment":"center"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/snedsvml","kind":"shape","name":"Shape 5","position":{"left":72,"top":192,"width":357.12,"height":369.6},"style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#F5F7FA","lineColor":"#D9DEE7","lineWidth":1.33},
{"id":"sh/jilcvq54","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 6","position":{"left":89.28,"top":203.52,"width":196.42,"height":26.88},"text":"みちびきの何を利用する？","style":{"fontSize":14.67,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/ihcvml4j","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 7","position":{"left":89.28,"top":238.08,"width":322.56,"height":310.08},"text":"SLASのL1S補強信号。\nGPS等の測位誤差を補正する。\n\n対象領域の公式水平精度は\n1.0m以下（95%）。\n受信機と環境に条件があり、\n首輪での達成は別途検証。\n\n利用料は不要。\n対応受信機が必要。","style":{"fontSize":21,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/4by9or6l","kind":"shape","name":"Shape 8","position":{"left":441.6,"top":192,"width":357.12,"height":369.6},"style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#F5F7FA","lineColor":"#D9DEE7","lineWidth":1.33},
{"id":"sh/pc7qhwn6","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 9","position":{"left":458.88,"top":203.52,"width":196.42,"height":26.88},"text":"なぜみちびきを使う？","style":{"fontSize":14.67,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/29grm1of","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 10","position":{"left":458.88,"top":238.08,"width":322.56,"height":310.08},"text":"屋外で探す範囲を絞る\n効果を狙う。\n\n同じ受信機で補正の有無を\n比較し、誤差と模擬捜索の\n所要時間を測る。\n\n地図自体の誤差や\n通信の遅れも含めて評価。\n屋内はBluetoothを使う。","style":{"fontSize":21,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/3ap8fm50","kind":"shape","name":"Shape 11","position":{"left":811.2,"top":192,"width":395.52,"height":369.6},"style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#F5F7FA","lineColor":"#D9DEE7","lineWidth":1.33},
{"id":"sh/gnepkr69","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 12","position":{"left":828.48,"top":203.52,"width":217.54,"height":26.88},"text":"みちびきがなかったら？","style":{"fontSize":14.67,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/honqdwnu","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 13","position":{"left":828.48,"top":238.08,"width":360.96,"height":310.08},"text":"通常のGNSSや2周波方式で\n同様のサービスは作れる。\n\nSLASが必須とは限らず、\n価格・消費電力・実測精度を\n比較して採用を判断する。\n\nSLASは位置の送信機能では\nないため、離れた飼い主への\n通知には別の通信が必要。","style":{"fontSize":21,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/0vepcbyl","kind":"textbox","name":"Slide Number Placeholder 0","position":{"left":1230,"top":684.48,"width":35,"height":24},"text":"16","style":{"fontSize":10.67,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#B5B5B5","alignment":"right"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/zul836xg","kind":"textbox","name":"source-disclosure-17","position":{"left":74.88,"top":630,"width":1120,"height":40},"text":"出典：内閣府「SLAS仕様」「みちびきFAQ」。屋内・地下では一般的な衛星受信機を利用できない。","style":{"fontSize":14.67,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#666666","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0}
]}
